    <dashboard name='Metric Definitions'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/Foodora/workbooks/APCorporateDailyEvergreenDiscount/MetricDefinitions?rev=' id='MetricDefinitions' path='/t/Foodora/workbooks/APCorporateDailyEvergreenandBPD' revision='' site='Foodora' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1200' maxwidth='1260' minheight='1200' minwidth='1260' preset-index='17' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='9583' id='164' type-v2='text' w='17698' x='635' y='667'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='24'>    foodpanda</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#b00f53' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='9583' id='165' type-v2='text' w='81032' x='18333' y='667'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='22'>   Definitions</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#e6e6e6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='73333' id='354' type-v2='text' w='98730' x='635' y='10250'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' underline='true'>Pantry Orders</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>1. PK Vendor Codes i9dw, dn56, k40w, i7b0,ulqu, lh8e</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>2. For all other countries, pandamart or shops orders &gt;= 100 EUR GMV</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' underline='true'>Evergreen Discount Report</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>1. Evergreen Discount filter refers to regular Evergreen Corporate Discount</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>2. Evergreen Shops Discount filter refers to HK Evergreen Shops Corporate Discount</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>3. Select &amp; unselect the correct filters to view the relevant discount (default filter is Evergreen Corporate Discount)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' underline='true'>Note on visible deals on front end</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>1. There can only be 1 live discount shown per vendor on the front end (i.e. website/app)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>2. In the event of multiple discounts uploaded for the same vendor, the discount with the latest created date by expedition type will be the one shown on the front end</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' underline='true'>List Of Vendors With No Deals</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Restaurant Vendor Count:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Restaurants only</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Active (i.e. live) status</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Accepts corporate or all customers (B2B and B2C) orders</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Accepts discounts and deliveries</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Has Any Delivery Deal</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Any live delivery discount as of current date</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Has No Delivery Deal</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- No live delivery discount as of current date</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Has Corporate Only Delivery Deal:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Any live delivery discount as of current date</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Discount is visible only on corporate platform (platform tagged as &quot;Corporate&quot; only)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Has Other Delivery Deal (Not Corporate Only):</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Any live delivery discount as of current date</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Discount is visible on all platforms (platform tagged as ALL or tagged as NULL by default)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Has Evergreen Deal:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Discount title starts with &quot;10% OFF ON CORPORATE&quot; or &quot;CORPORATE 10% OFF&quot;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Discount description includes &quot;corporate exclusive discount&quot; (TW)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Discount starts from Nov 2020 onwards</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Has Stack Deal:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Discount description includes &quot;CORPORATE EXCLUSIVE DISCOUNT - corporate clients enjoy up to XXX&quot;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Expedition type is delivery only</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Discount starts from 1 Feb 2021 onwards</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Has Other Corporate Only Delivery Deal</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Discount is visible only on corporate platform (platform tagged as &quot;Corporate&quot; only)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Discount title does not start with &quot;10% OFF ON CORPORATE&quot; or &quot;CORPORATE 10% OFF&quot;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Discount description does not include &quot;corporate exclusive discount&quot; (TW)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Discount description does not include &quot;CORPORATE EXCLUSIVE DISCOUNT - corporate clients enjoy up to XXX&quot;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='15750' id='465' is-centered='0' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Delivery Deal Breakdown.JPG' type-v2='bitmap' w='98730' x='635' y='83583'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
